PeepeeBox is a fork of 86Box.

The emulator
------------

Essentially all of the code in this repository is 86Box, and all credit for it
belongs to the 86Box project and its authors:

    Miran Grča (OBattler), RichardG867, Jasmine Iwanek, TC1995, coldbrewed,
    Teemu Korhonen (Manaatti), Joakim L. Gilje, Adrien Moulin (elyosh),
    Daniel Balsom (gloriouscow), Cacodemon345, Fred N. van Kempen (waltje),
    Tiseno100, reenigne, and others.

With previous core contributions from Sarah Walker, leilei, JohnElliott,
greatpsycho, and others.

Per-file authorship is documented at the top of each source file, and those
notices are left intact wherever PeepeeBox has modified a file. They own portions
of the code, or in cases, the entirety of it.

    https://github.com/86Box/86Box

The ROM images under roms/ are reproduced from the upstream 86Box ROM
repository and remain the property of their respective copyright owners.

    https://github.com/86Box/roms

The fork
--------

The Photo Play / I.G.O. protection research, the HASP and DS1982 iButton
emulation, and the reduction of 86Box to this single machine are by the
HUEG PP team.

